# ============================================================================
#  Dev Test Range -- the only map carrying every vehicle in the game.
#  Flat and open on purpose: handling, ballistics and effects are all easy
#  to read with nothing in the way. Single player starts in god mode here.
#
#  car   <x> <z> <y> <turn 0-3> <kind 0 saloon 1 van 3 supercar> <r> <g> <b>
#  tank  <x> <z> <y> <turn 0-3> <r> <g> <b>
#  heli  <x> <z> <y> <turn 0-3> <r> <g> <b>
#  E to get in, WASD to drive or fly, SPACE or E to get out.
# ============================================================================

name Dev Test Range
size 3400 3400
ground floor 128
fog 40 56 66 900 3600
sky 30 40 50

